/vm.cljc:273:(defn fresh-code-loader\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/ledger.cljc:44:   (`vm/semantic-contract`). A `:derive` record\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/ledger.cljc:49:   :yin.code/contract vm/semantic-contract\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/semantic.cljc:691:   `contract` is required and compared with `vm/semantic-contract` before\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/semantic.cljc:695:  (vm/check-contract! vm/semantic-contract contract)\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/semantic.cljc:742:   `contract` is required and compared with `vm/semantic-contract` before\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/semantic.cljc:746:   (vm/check-contract! vm/semantic-contract contract)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
